            "overlay_title": false,
            "overlay_title_position": "bottom",
            "title": "Cocktail Recipes",
            "text": "<p>Try your hand at an array of cocktails all with a moonshine twist! Give your classic mojito a makeover or discover something new!</p>",
            "mobile_text": "<p>To give your classic Mojito a Moonshine makeover, swap out the rum and bring in O’Donnell Vodka and a generous measure of our Lime Moonshine!</p>",
