            "overlay_title": false,
            "overlay_title_position": "bottom",
            "title": "Award Successes",
            "text": "<p>The Spirits Business Global Spirits Master Awards, we are delighted to announce that O'Donnell Moonshine have been honoured with five awards at the 2024 edition of the awards. </p>",
            "mobile_text": "<p>Following on from our success at the 2023 The Spirits Business Global Spirits Master Awards, we are delighted to announce that O'Donnell Moonshine have been honoured with not one, not two, but five awards at the 2024 edition of the awards. </p>",
